{"id":"93f1683ca340f61b","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-henkin-provable.md","title":"Every Henkin Fixed Point Is a GL Theorem","display":"cor-henkin-provable — Every Henkin Fixed Point Is a GL Theorem","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-henkin-provable","aliases":["89-cor-henkin-provable"],"display":"cor-henkin-provable — Every Henkin Fixed Point Is a GL Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-lob-axiom]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-henkin-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-henkin-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-henkin-provable — Every Henkin Fixed Point Is a GL Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"728ff257684515d2\" href=\"?note=728ff257684515d2\" title=\"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal\">89-df-henkin-sentence-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\)</span> 为 Henkin 类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H_{\\Box}=\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\">\\(\\mathcal H_{\\Box}=\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\)</span> 为固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的旧记号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为 Gödel–Löb 定理集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\;(H\\in\\mathrm{GL}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\;(H\\in\\mathrm{GL}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 11、105；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>类定义给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H\\to H\">\\(\\Box H\\to H\\)</span> 可证。对这条定理必然化得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box(\\Box H\\to H)\">\\(\\Box(\\Box H\\to H)\\)</span>，应用 Löb 公理得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box H\">\\(\\Box H\\)</span>，再用同一蕴含 MP 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>。本证明实际导出 Löb 规则，不把仅定义规则可容许性谓词的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b22854791214adbd\" href=\"?note=b22854791214adbd\" title=\"89-df-lob-derivation\">89-df-lob-derivation</a> 当作规则已经成立的证据。显式参数下的结论与旧固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 记号的全称结论相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-henkin-sentence-modal","status":"resolved","id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-sentence-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"491579297d817026","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-lob-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"b22854791214adbd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"类定义给 $\\Box H\\to H$ 可证。对这条定理必然化得 $\\Box(\\Box H\\to H)$，应用 Löb 公理得 $\\Box H$，再用同一蕴含 MP 得 $H$。本证明实际导出 Löb 规则，不把仅定义规则可容许性谓词的 [[89-df-lob-derivation]] 当作规则已经成立的证据。显式参数下的结论与旧固定 $p$ 记号的全称结论相同。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H_{\\Box}=\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}provable}\\vdash\n\\forall H\\in\\mathcal H_{\\Box,p}\\;(H\\in\\mathrm{GL}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box H\\to H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box(\\Box H\\to H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box H","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1198,"backlinks":[{"id":"728ff257684515d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"成员 $H$ 不含被消去的 $p$，且 $(H\\leftrightarrow\\Box H)\\in\\mathrm{GL}$。$p$ 现在是显式类参数，旧记号只能在已固定 $p$ 时引用。此处给类定义，不预设成员已经存在。$\\Box p$ 模态化，故弱条件与原书加强条件等价。\n算术实现下得到 $H^*$ 与自身可证性之间的可证等价。进一步的可证性来自 Löb 规则，见 [[89-cor-henkin-provable]]；具体代表为 $\\top$，见 [[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-504","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-cor-henkin-provable]]"}],"outgoing":["728ff257684515d2","0006800fa1c85177","491579297d817026","b22854791214adbd"]}